{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106523","id":2526079173,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6WkOjF","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106523","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106523.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106523.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106523","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106523/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106523/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106523/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/a958f29ff92f417512443d072d18ac9118d85428","number":106523,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Convert if/else chain to switch statement","user":{"login":"nukethebees","id":4354670,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzNTQ2NzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4354670?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nukethebees","html_url":"https://github.com/nukethebees","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nukethebees/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nukethebees/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nukethebees/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nukethebees/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nukethebees/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nukethebees/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nukethebees/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nukethebees/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nukethebees/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"`RendererSceneCull::_scene_cull` contains a large if/else chain which can be converted to a switch statement. In MSVC's optimised assembly, all if/else checks are done sequentially whereas the switch jumps directly. The if/else probably wasn't optimised as the final conditional isn't versus a constant (but we can just handle that in the `default` branch).\r\n\r\nPart of the original `if/else` asm with MSVC:\r\n\r\n```\r\n  2840: \t\t\t\tuint32_t base_type = idata.flags & InstanceData::FLAG_BASE_TYPE_MASK;\r\nmov         r13d,1  \r\nmov         edx,dword ptr [r15]  \r\nmovzx       ecx,dl  \r\n  2841: \t\t\t\tif (base_type == RS::INSTANCE_LIGHT) {\r\ncmp         ecx,5  \r\njne         RendererSceneCull::_scene_cull+1122h (07FF7A6806AD2h)  \r\n\r\n\r\n  2848: \t\t\t\t} else if (base_type == RS::INSTANCE_REFLECTION_PROBE) {\r\ncmp         ecx,6  \r\njne         RendererSceneCull::_scene_cull+1298h (07FF7A6806C48h)\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n  2868: \t\t\t\t} else if (base_type == RS::INSTANCE_DECAL) {\r\ncmp         ecx,7  \r\njne         RendererSceneCull::_scene_cull+1370h (07FF7A6806D20h)  \r\n```\r\nAnd so on. New `switch` asm:\r\n\r\n```\r\n  2842: \t\t\t\tswitch (base_type) {\r\nlea         eax,[rdx-5]  \r\ncmp         eax,7  \r\nja          $LN48+0BFh (07FF6BFFC703Ch)  \r\nlea         rbx,[__ImageBase (07FF6BAE40000h)]  \r\nmov         ecx,dword ptr [rbx+rax*4+5188C14h]  \r\nadd         rcx,rbx  \r\njmp         rcx  \r\n```","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2304948121,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMzA0OTQ4MTIx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:codestyle","name":"topic:codestyle","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","description":"","color":"447777","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":5793,"closed_issues":0,"created_at":"2022-07-26T12:42:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T14:39:14Z","closed_at":null,"due_on":null},"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-05-17T13:15:21Z","updated_at":"2026-02-17T20:10:27Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sh